akari (0.17.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Willkommen: a window after sign-in with a short scene (lucya.systems'
    eagle builds as on the old lucya.sh splash, then Akari's mark), light
    or dark as the desktop is, and five pages: what Akari is, finding one's
    way, the Linux underneath, lucya.systems, accent and light. "Nicht mehr
    anzeigen" holds for the account; the start menu keeps the app.
  * A new account starts light.
  * The start menu glides between pinned and all apps and springs to its
    new height; its scrolling parts draw a thin bar of their own instead of
    the browser's, which pushed the grid sideways.
  * Farbverlauf: windows stay above the desktop icons.
  * New glass icon for Willkommen; design/icons/apps.py patches up to the
    last app symbol.

