akari (0.11.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The console shows the address also on networks without a default route
    (host-only networks of VMs), and an IPv6 address if there is no other;
    its check keeps running after an error.
  * Right after boot the console says it waits for the network and looks
    every second, and akarid starts once the network is online: the
    address is there as soon as DHCP is done, not up to ten seconds later.

